            "text_8AJ3KQ": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Let's face it—there's nothing more discouraging than watching fine lines and dullness creep in every year.</p><p><strong>Every skipped night of skincare instantly makes your complexion look tired, dry, and older than you feel...</strong></p><p>And the price tags on dermatologist visits, injectables, and premium spa facials aren't just high—they're <strong>mind-blowing.</strong></p><h2>On Average, Women Spend More Than $9,000 On Anti-Aging Treatments Over Their Lifetime</h2><p>Industry surveys suggest the average person spends thousands of dollars over the years on treatments, facials, and products chasing smoother skin.</p><p>But it's not just the cost. <strong>Harsh retinoids and aggressive treatments can leave skin red, peeling, and more sensitive than before.</strong></p><h2>Just One Step That Can Transform Your Routine</h2><p>You can help <strong>visibly smooth and hydrate your skin</strong> with just one simple step, morning and night.</p>",
                "enable_text_truncation": false,
