            "text_j3QT3X": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>RenewLift™ isn't just another serum—it's a <strong>lightweight, fast-absorbing formula</strong> built around a peptide complex and hyaluronic acid, formulated without harsh retinoids or fragrance that can irritate sensitive skin.</p><p>Smooth a few drops over cleansed skin and it works like a daily moisture veil—leaving your complexion looking <strong>dewy and refreshed</strong>.</p><p>This formula also helps <strong>support your skin's natural moisture barrier</strong>, so skin looks plumper and more resilient over time.</p><h2>Why Choose RenewLift™?</h2><p>✅ <strong>Fast-Absorbing Formula:</strong> Lightweight texture sinks in within seconds, no greasy residue.</p><p>✅ <strong>Visibly Smoother Skin:</strong> Helps soften the look of fine lines and uneven texture.</p><p>✅ <strong>Deep Hydration:</strong> Hyaluronic acid helps skin look plumper and more supple.</p><p>✅ <strong>Gentle On Sensitive Skin:</strong> Fragrance-free, dermatologist-developed formula.</p><p>✅ <strong>Dewy, Radiant Finish:</strong> Leaves complexion looking refreshed, never oily.</p><p>✅ <strong>Easy To Use:</strong> Apply 2–3 drops morning and night after cleansing.</p>",
                "enable_text_truncation": false,
